  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Security Nylon Rain Jacket is composed of waterproof PVC coated materials to keep security officials dry while on-the-job. The rain jacket features 100% waterproof materials and a full length zipper closure with a storm flap to keep you dry reliably. The tactical jacket also features a rustproof zipper for years of use, as well as a drawstring spring-lock adjustable hood. Adjustable hook and loop closures form a seamless seal between your jacket and gloves, while dual entry jacket pockets are reinforced with rivets for durability.&nbsp;</p>",
